WEBVTT

00:33.687 --> 00:36.962
=Royal Upstart 2=
(Based on "Zhenguan Foolish Son-in-Law")

00:37.437 --> 00:39.800
=Episode 12=

00:39.950 --> 00:42.512
(Do Not Call Me Father-in-Law)

00:47.519 --> 00:48.519
The steward?

00:50.120 --> 00:51.080
It is me.

00:51.119 --> 00:52.160
What...

00:52.359 --> 00:53.039
What?

00:53.880 --> 00:54.640
What is this about?

00:54.880 --> 00:55.240
You...

00:55.880 --> 00:56.519
You...

00:57.359 --> 00:58.320
Your Majesty?

00:58.839 --> 01:00.640
This is unreal.

01:00.640 --> 01:01.320
What?

01:01.660 --> 01:02.559
Do I not look like it?

01:04.640 --> 01:05.440
No.

01:05.600 --> 01:07.320
No... You do.

01:07.399 --> 01:08.120
You...

01:09.039 --> 01:09.839
I...

01:12.239 --> 01:13.039
So,

01:15.640 --> 01:17.799
let me make sense of this.

01:17.799 --> 01:18.759
Make sense of what?

01:19.200 --> 01:20.159
Of how

01:20.640 --> 01:22.840
you spoke to me before?

01:22.840 --> 01:23.640
Calling me

01:24.560 --> 01:25.359
a fool,

01:25.719 --> 01:27.479
saying I do not
understand state affairs?

01:29.200 --> 01:30.000
Who said that?

01:30.010 --> 01:31.320
Who would dare speak
to His Majesty like that?

01:31.320 --> 01:32.520
You did.

01:32.520 --> 01:33.560
Your Majesty, give me a moment.

01:33.560 --> 01:34.520
Let me sort this out.

01:34.530 --> 01:35.770
I am a bit confused right now.

01:36.119 --> 01:38.320
You are the steward of the girl,

01:38.320 --> 01:39.479
and you are also her father.

01:39.640 --> 01:43.159
Then why would you serve
as steward to an unfavored daughter?

01:43.719 --> 01:44.719
Unfavored?

01:46.039 --> 01:47.879
Do you even know who Ning'an is?

01:47.879 --> 01:49.200
Of course I know who Ning'an is.

01:49.200 --> 01:50.380
Who are you calling nonsense?

01:50.390 --> 01:51.359
Who is talking nonsense?

01:51.359 --> 01:52.280
How would I know?

01:52.319 --> 01:53.319
Wait, you...

01:55.400 --> 01:57.159
You are not an impostor, are you?

01:58.599 --> 01:59.439
That cannot be.

01:59.719 --> 02:01.599
Showing up in the palace this early,

02:01.599 --> 02:02.280
you...

02:02.640 --> 02:03.840
You are not an impostor?

02:04.040 --> 02:04.840
Wei Hao.

02:05.359 --> 02:07.159
Ning'an is also called Baoqing.

02:07.519 --> 02:08.799
Do you understand now?

02:10.120 --> 02:11.599
She has another name?

02:11.840 --> 02:12.760
Why does she

02:12.879 --> 02:14.280
have so many names?

02:14.280 --> 02:14.840
You...

02:15.159 --> 02:16.959
What are you talking about?

02:16.959 --> 02:17.959
Wei Ning'an,

02:18.519 --> 02:20.920
my daughter, the eldest daughter
of the Great Yong,

02:20.920 --> 02:22.159
Princess Baoqing.

02:22.300 --> 02:23.480
You have never heard of that?

02:23.480 --> 02:24.970
There are people who do not know this?

02:28.200 --> 02:29.000
She

02:29.280 --> 02:30.959
is the eldest princess?

02:31.100 --> 02:32.319
Is it not said among the people

02:32.319 --> 02:34.159
that the eldest princess
is the most favored?

02:34.560 --> 02:36.680
You truly did not know?

02:39.920 --> 02:40.719
It does not matter

02:41.920 --> 02:43.480
whether she is favored or not.

02:43.959 --> 02:44.760
Father-in-law,

02:44.879 --> 02:46.200
then about my matter with Ning'an,

02:46.480 --> 02:47.439
you agree?

02:47.640 --> 02:48.760
What did you just call me?

02:49.040 --> 02:50.120
Nothing, Father-in-law.

02:50.159 --> 02:51.800
Ning'an will not suffer following me.

02:51.800 --> 02:52.879
I can make money.

02:54.039 --> 02:54.590
By the way...

02:54.960 --> 02:57.599
(No one has ever called me
father-in-law before.)

02:57.599 --> 02:59.439
(This fool
actually calls me father-in-law.)

02:59.439 --> 03:00.080
(This...)

03:00.840 --> 03:03.280
(Why does it feel somewhat familiar?)

03:04.439 --> 03:06.479
Father-in-law, take a look at this.

03:08.039 --> 03:09.360
What is this?

03:13.439 --> 03:14.000
Try it.

03:26.400 --> 03:27.240
Salt?

03:38.680 --> 03:39.479
Why

03:40.280 --> 03:41.759
is it so fine?

03:43.400 --> 03:44.439
As far as I know,

03:44.680 --> 03:46.560
salt has always
been managed by the court.

03:46.560 --> 03:49.290
But the current salt output in
the Great Yong is far from sufficient.

03:49.400 --> 03:50.680
The salt on the market now

03:50.879 --> 03:52.599
sells for ten wen per liang,

03:52.599 --> 03:54.599
so one jin costs one hundred sixty wen,

03:54.599 --> 03:55.199
correct?

03:55.599 --> 03:58.000
Based on the current population
of the Great Yong,

03:58.000 --> 04:00.000
there are about sixteen million people.

04:00.080 --> 04:02.280
If each person
uses half a jin of salt a year,

04:02.280 --> 04:03.599
that is eight million jin.

04:03.599 --> 04:06.439
Eight million jin amounts to
one million two hundred thousand guan.

04:06.900 --> 04:09.360
And the cost of producing salt
is only about two hundred thousand guan.

04:09.360 --> 04:10.520
So salt alone

04:10.680 --> 04:12.759
brings nearly a million in profit.

04:13.190 --> 04:14.800
That is how the accounts are calculated,

04:15.000 --> 04:17.560
but the actual annual salt output
of the Great Yong

04:17.599 --> 04:19.080
is less than two hundred thousand jin.

04:19.520 --> 04:21.840
Most people cannot afford it.

04:23.479 --> 04:25.919
Salt production is not simple.

04:26.159 --> 04:27.599
It requires a complicated process.

04:27.599 --> 04:28.960
What is so complicated about it?

04:29.360 --> 04:30.960
There is nothing difficult about this.

04:31.879 --> 04:33.840
As long as you give me enough crude salt

04:33.840 --> 04:34.719
or salt fields,

04:35.000 --> 04:37.280
I can refine
one hundred thousand jin in a day.

04:39.439 --> 04:40.919
One hundred thousand jin?

04:42.680 --> 04:44.520
You... Forget one hundred thousand.

04:44.520 --> 04:47.120
If you can produce ten thousand jin,

04:47.159 --> 04:49.639
I will put you in charge
of all the salt fields in the realm.

04:50.240 --> 04:50.919
No.

04:51.200 --> 04:52.840
Why would I take on that responsibility?

04:53.439 --> 04:54.599
You were

04:54.639 --> 04:57.080
talking big just now,
and now you are backing out?

04:57.080 --> 04:58.759
That is deceiving the throne.

04:59.120 --> 05:00.240
I am not backing out.

05:02.920 --> 05:04.240
I have already written down

05:04.250 --> 05:05.880
the whole salt-making method
on this paper.

05:06.480 --> 05:09.439
What is needed, how it is made,
how the proportions are set,

05:09.439 --> 05:10.720
it is all there.

05:10.720 --> 05:12.199
I am not taking that on.

05:12.720 --> 05:13.800
Why would I bother with it?

05:13.800 --> 05:14.959
It is not even my business.

05:16.399 --> 05:17.480
What you wrote here,

05:17.720 --> 05:18.639
can it actually work?

05:19.000 --> 05:20.560
Of course it can.

05:20.560 --> 05:22.319
I made it very clear.

05:24.262 --> 05:26.137
(Boiling and concentrating. Baking
to crystallize. Cooling for purification.)

05:27.759 --> 05:30.079
There is something worthwhile here.

05:33.800 --> 05:35.600
I will have
the Ministry of Works handle it.

05:39.560 --> 05:40.360
Father-in-law,

05:41.079 --> 05:41.639
then about

05:42.120 --> 05:44.399
my matter with Ning'an...

05:47.040 --> 05:48.839
Wei the Fool, I warn you.

05:48.839 --> 05:50.220
If you call me father-in-law again,

05:50.360 --> 05:52.920
I will have you locked up
in the Ministry of Justice Prison.

05:52.920 --> 05:53.759
Do you hear me?

05:54.120 --> 05:55.360
Father-in-law,

05:55.680 --> 05:57.639
you have already taken this,

05:57.800 --> 05:59.279
and I have given you the method.

05:59.400 --> 06:00.480
You cannot do me like this.

06:00.480 --> 06:01.319
Your Majesty,

06:01.519 --> 06:03.360
the Eldest Princess
requests an audience.

06:04.040 --> 06:05.079
Let her in.

06:05.079 --> 06:05.800
Yes.

06:12.000 --> 06:13.040
(Fortunately,)

06:13.399 --> 06:15.639
(if my daughter knew I almost wavered,)

06:15.759 --> 06:17.519
(she would surely make a scene.)

06:23.000 --> 06:25.240
Eldest Princess.

06:28.130 --> 06:29.480
Well now, you really had me fooled.

06:29.480 --> 06:31.519
Did you not tell me
you were a fallen princess?

06:31.700 --> 06:33.040
It would be one thing
if you fooled me alone,

06:33.040 --> 06:34.399
but you even teamed up to fool me.

06:34.439 --> 06:35.879
That is clearly my father-in-law,

06:35.879 --> 06:37.199
yet you insisted he was a steward.

06:37.199 --> 06:38.680
You really had me going.

06:39.639 --> 06:41.079
Who teamed up to fool you?

06:41.480 --> 06:43.199
You failed to see it. Who can you blame?

06:43.199 --> 06:44.000
Exactly.

06:46.040 --> 06:46.480
I...

06:48.120 --> 06:49.040
No, Father-in-law,

06:49.439 --> 06:50.680
go out on the street right now

06:50.759 --> 06:52.000
and ask anyone.

06:52.120 --> 06:54.000
Ask them if they know your name.

06:54.000 --> 06:54.439
No...

06:54.439 --> 06:55.439
I have never even seen you before.

06:55.439 --> 06:56.439
How would I know who you are?

06:56.439 --> 06:57.990
You father and daughter
are both unreasonable.

06:58.000 --> 06:58.920
Father-in-law?

06:59.000 --> 07:00.120
Who are you calling father-in-law?

07:00.120 --> 07:01.000
Do not call me that.

07:01.000 --> 07:01.720
Enough.

07:01.730 --> 07:03.370
I have something
to discuss with father-in-law.

07:03.399 --> 07:03.959
As for you,

07:03.959 --> 07:05.120
I will deal with you later.

07:05.240 --> 07:06.199
Wei the Fool,

07:06.210 --> 07:07.600
who are you settling accounts with?

07:08.040 --> 07:08.560
You...

07:09.040 --> 07:10.279
You are truly infuriating.

07:10.759 --> 07:11.680
Go back.

07:11.730 --> 07:13.120
I do not wish to see you right now.

07:18.920 --> 07:19.439
Fine.

07:19.639 --> 07:20.439
Come on, girl.

07:20.580 --> 07:21.800
Father-in-law told us to leave.

07:21.800 --> 07:23.150
Come have lunch at my place later.

07:23.360 --> 07:23.800
Let us go.

07:23.920 --> 07:25.000
Let go of her.

07:27.079 --> 07:28.199
What are you doing?

07:33.600 --> 07:34.560
Wei the Fool,

07:34.839 --> 07:36.600
you can barely look after yourself,

07:36.600 --> 07:37.970
yet you still cling to my daughter.

07:38.680 --> 07:40.040
Look at these memorials.

07:40.520 --> 07:42.720
They accuse you of selling glaze
to the Hu merchants,

07:42.959 --> 07:44.439
and of colluding with Beicang.

07:44.500 --> 07:45.759
Together with the previous ones,

07:45.759 --> 07:47.439
there are over a hundred already.

07:47.800 --> 07:48.839
Father-in-law,

07:49.399 --> 07:50.920
you know I did that on purpose.

07:50.920 --> 07:53.000
Those great clans
are just jealous of my workshop.

07:53.720 --> 07:55.480
No, how did a perfectly good Great Yong

07:55.480 --> 07:56.879
end up being controlled by these clans?

07:56.879 --> 07:58.199
Controlled?

07:58.199 --> 07:59.120
I am still here.

07:59.120 --> 08:00.399
If they push me too far,

08:00.399 --> 08:02.040
I will root them out completely.

08:02.439 --> 08:03.240
Then,

08:03.639 --> 08:05.360
do you have a way to deal with them?

08:06.639 --> 08:09.160
The printing method
you mentioned before?

08:09.279 --> 08:10.920
Not the kind you use now.

08:11.879 --> 08:13.240
I cannot reveal it yet.

08:13.240 --> 08:13.959
If I do,

08:13.959 --> 08:15.240
they will come after me for sure.

08:16.319 --> 08:18.560
(If this fool really has such a method,)

08:18.839 --> 08:21.199
(then there is hope of dealing
with the great clans.)

08:21.439 --> 08:22.319
Wei the Fool,

08:23.079 --> 08:24.240
I will protect you.

08:24.720 --> 08:25.759
You stand with me?

08:26.279 --> 08:27.079
That will not work.

08:27.600 --> 08:29.279
You are in the palace, I am outside.

08:29.279 --> 08:30.639
If I am killed, you would not even know.

08:30.639 --> 08:31.639
You fool.

08:31.639 --> 08:33.319
Stop talking nonsense
in front of Father.

08:33.759 --> 08:34.759
What nonsense?

08:35.120 --> 08:36.079
Just watch.

08:36.279 --> 08:37.519
Within twenty years,

08:37.639 --> 08:40.120
half the officials from the great clans
in court will be gone.

08:41.040 --> 08:43.959
You are from the Wei clan yourself.

08:44.240 --> 08:46.079
If you use this method,

08:46.079 --> 08:48.519
are you not afraid
of bringing trouble to your own family?

08:48.560 --> 08:49.519
I may be surnamed Wei,

08:49.959 --> 08:52.040
but I cannot stand those great clans.

08:52.040 --> 08:53.800
Why should they control
the power of the realm

08:53.800 --> 08:55.560
and hoard all its wealth?

08:55.720 --> 08:56.879
I am only a County Lord,

08:56.879 --> 08:58.720
yet they dare
to openly seize my workshop.

08:58.720 --> 09:00.279
Then what chance do ordinary people have

09:00.279 --> 09:01.639
to seek justice?

09:02.959 --> 09:05.639
Father-in-law, the more I think about it,
the more wrong it feels.

09:06.120 --> 09:06.680
Tell me,

09:07.000 --> 09:08.839
why should those from humble families

09:08.839 --> 09:10.390
have their
entire lives decided at birth?

09:10.759 --> 09:12.000
They cannot become officials,

09:12.000 --> 09:15.039
they cannot even earn enough
to improve their families' lives.

09:15.320 --> 09:16.200
These great clans

09:16.200 --> 09:17.279
have gone too far.

09:19.510 --> 09:21.580
If you truly have such ability,
that would be best.

09:21.960 --> 09:22.639
However,

09:22.879 --> 09:24.480
what you said just now

09:24.480 --> 09:26.039
stays between the three of us.

09:26.039 --> 09:27.240
Do not let it spread.

09:27.240 --> 09:29.320
If word gets out,

09:29.600 --> 09:31.200
be careful with your head.

09:32.279 --> 09:33.200
I know.

09:33.600 --> 09:35.080
I am just speaking with you.

09:36.039 --> 09:36.840
Your Majesty,

09:37.879 --> 09:40.360
the Empress has learned
that Lord Wei is in the palace.

09:40.600 --> 09:43.000
She has instructed
that after his audience,

09:43.159 --> 09:44.559
he should go to Fengluan Palace.

09:45.919 --> 09:47.120
Mother-in-law wants to see me?

09:47.679 --> 09:47.960
Wait,

09:47.960 --> 09:49.759
why did you not tell me earlier?

09:49.759 --> 09:51.039
I did not bring any gift.

09:51.399 --> 09:53.720
When you meet Mother later,
do not address her carelessly.

09:53.879 --> 09:54.879
Do not worry.

09:54.879 --> 09:55.399
I will not embarrass you.

09:55.399 --> 09:56.360
Just go.

09:58.240 --> 09:59.759
(That is meeting my mother-in-law.)

09:59.960 --> 10:01.879
(She matters more
than the father-in-law.)

10:02.279 --> 10:03.720
(As long as I win her over,)

10:03.840 --> 10:05.799
(the rest will be easy.)

10:06.120 --> 10:06.679
Let us go.

10:18.879 --> 10:19.559
Your Majesty,

10:19.800 --> 10:21.159
Your Majesty, are you heading out?

10:21.210 --> 10:23.200
I am going with Father-in-law
to see Mother-in-law.

10:23.200 --> 10:23.679
Father...

10:24.000 --> 10:24.799
Father-in-law?

10:25.220 --> 10:26.200
What are you calling me?

10:26.200 --> 10:27.080
My father-in-law.

10:28.080 --> 10:28.559
This...

10:29.480 --> 10:30.080
This...

10:30.960 --> 10:31.799
Your father-in-law?

10:34.279 --> 10:36.799
(His Majesty is actually not objecting
to being called that.)

10:44.487 --> 10:47.317
♪Everyone says I'm a big silly fool♪

10:47.937 --> 10:51.337
♪When things happen,
I only know how to count on my fingers♪

10:52.107 --> 10:55.057
♪They shake their heads
and say I'm pitiful♪

10:55.397 --> 10:58.097
♪Sigh and walk away♪

10:59.697 --> 11:03.167
♪Little do they know,
I am sharp and bright♪

11:03.167 --> 11:05.397
♪With a heart like a mirror,
I understand the world's♪

11:05.397 --> 11:07.507
♪Colors and darkness♪

11:07.507 --> 11:09.527
♪But I keep my edge hidden♪

11:09.527 --> 11:13.887
♪The day I become famous
is just around the corner♪

11:15.327 --> 11:19.057
♪In the hotpot restaurant,
skewers boil in the broth♪

11:19.327 --> 11:22.927
♪People come and go,
with few worries or troubles♪

11:23.087 --> 11:25.167
♪The clacking of the abacus rings out♪

11:25.167 --> 11:29.957
♪See me differently.
Who dares to challenge me?♪

11:30.177 --> 11:31.797
♪The world mistakes me♪

11:31.797 --> 11:34.137
♪For an ignorant and stubborn fool♪

11:34.207 --> 11:35.397
♪As the storm approaches♪

11:35.397 --> 11:37.797
♪I just shrug and watch with a smile♪

11:38.007 --> 11:39.727
♪This foolish image is convenient♪

11:39.727 --> 11:41.707
♪I use it as a protective shield♪

11:41.877 --> 11:43.627
♪Navigating with ease, I attract♪

11:43.627 --> 11:45.727
♪A lucky star to accompany me♪

11:45.727 --> 11:47.197
♪In a peaceful golden age♪

11:47.197 --> 11:49.427
♪I hold my lady's hand
to watch the world♪

11:49.647 --> 11:50.847
♪Pouring youth and fireworks♪

11:50.847 --> 11:53.367
♪Into a precious glazed cup♪

11:53.497 --> 11:55.207
♪Having experienced life's changes♪

11:55.207 --> 11:56.487
♪And tasted its highs and lows♪

11:56.637 --> 11:58.057
♪My wish has finally come true♪

11:58.057 --> 11:59.097
♪To stay by your side♪

11:59.097 --> 12:01.017
♪In this fleeting world♪

12:01.187 --> 12:04.437
♪We are free and happy♪

12:08.437 --> 12:10.217
♪From a nobody♪

12:10.217 --> 12:12.117
♪To someone now famous♪

12:12.227 --> 12:13.657
♪Ordinary people laugh at me♪

12:13.657 --> 12:16.167
♪But I laugh at how
they cannot see through it all♪

12:16.267 --> 12:17.847
♪Let others plot and scheme♪

12:17.847 --> 12:19.917
♪I will keep my heart unchanged♪

12:20.127 --> 12:21.807
♪In this vast world♪

12:21.807 --> 12:23.807
♪I find my own leisurely freedom♪

12:23.957 --> 12:26.167
♪The world is bustling,
and things constantly change♪

12:26.167 --> 12:27.757
♪Everything ends eventually♪

12:27.847 --> 12:29.347
♪All that remains before my eyes♪

12:29.347 --> 12:31.747
♪Is this street wandering,
still tinged with pity♪

12:31.747 --> 12:33.457
♪No matter how time flies♪

12:33.457 --> 12:34.617
♪Even if the falling snow♪

12:34.617 --> 12:36.247
♪Dyes the hair at our temples white♪

12:36.247 --> 12:37.287
♪All I want now♪

12:37.287 --> 12:39.387
♪Is to pray for
my lady's peace and safety♪

12:39.387 --> 12:42.647
♪Year after year♪
